    {"entry_index":20,"uid":"zhcn:6776dd20368b932c875870a9","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"生日想要什么？那、那就……\n今天一天，让我独占姐姐吧！\n……可以吗？","source_fingerprint":"45441d7085eedcb8b8b336522f43831352b8c134a69ca845de6d78a70d966e82","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1114","10114"],"target_text":"Sinh nhật em muốn gì à? V-vậy thì…\nHôm nay, cho em độc chiếm chị cả ngày nhé!\n…Được không?","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":21,"uid":"zhcn:ecc49523999d6d09af0f5076","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"Cygames","source_fingerprint":"70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1114","11"],"target_text":"Cygames","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":22,"uid":"zhcn:0eb8f6846bc64c753d2f599a","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"要训练了吗？那我们\n来照着商讨时说的进行吧♪","source_fingerprint":"868964e6b9eae108b1157637c097e2ce860c4369c0f34579a9ba5c9dcfd517ff","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1114","110000"],"target_text":"Sắp tập luyện rồi à? Vậy thì chúng ta\ncứ làm như đã bàn bạc nhé♪","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":23,"uid":"zhcn:5be891d441e1d6051154fe75","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"众多赛马娘有的如愿以偿，\n有的黯然止步……\n历史，很厚重……很有戏剧性呢。","source_fingerprint":"3a515e16b4eb183c597fb9f0c19f32738569c895dde2e33dbd68b4011997833c","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1114","110001"],"target_text":"Bao Mã Nương có người toại nguyện,\ncó người đành dừng bước trong tiếc nuối…\nLịch sử thật sâu dày… và đầy kịch tính nhỉ.","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":24,"uid":"zhcn:740aa27b11cb273b6d2712e0","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"要报名参赛吗？\n呵呵，好巧啊！\n正好我也在想同样的事。","source_fingerprint":"83ffb4f1e3892b0e0fb71d6114eaad4f787211e1f6cd834603239dc76e7675e0","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1114","110002"],"target_text":"Đăng ký thi đấu à?\nHì hì, trùng hợp thật!\nEm cũng vừa nghĩ đúng như vậy.","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":25,"uid":"zhcn:da8b88fde3e74b1e17f105d2","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"赛马娘 Pretty Derby！","source_fingerprint":"c68d1ccbe412517d037eba3349a53caf52ee4216f3314987c5d59645520f8f8a","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1114","12"],"target_text":"Uma Musume Pretty Derby!","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":26,"uid":"zhcn:d156890791bbf030b3b49b1b","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"大家的心意我都会带上的……！","source_fingerprint":"5428f1134d0c54541cd86d733238fa1cee29a30d6de81d49a184df4beabaf8fb","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1114","120000"],"target_text":"Em sẽ mang theo tất cả tấm lòng của mọi người…!","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":27,"uid":"zhcn:44ccb7d97064b999db10440c","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"把憧憬变成力量！","source_fingerprint":"12c975429e84a9a9372f88c3255e2ecb7a98d6ea6b5d395205716b18c4d10e2d","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1114","1250"],"target_text":"Biến niềm ngưỡng mộ thành sức mạnh!","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":28,"uid":"zhcn:6467c199838bc513639673d9","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"直到抵达绝景！","source_fingerprint":"586196f7e81822c460a980176340065c5e8530c7d763f1efed4ef56e5c222bb6","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1114","1251"],"target_text":"Cho đến khi chạm tới cảnh sắc tuyệt đỉnh!","reviewed":true},
